    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH05_P02_L002",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P02_F02",
      "panel_id": "p52_magnetic_hall",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "kind": "narration",
      "spoken_text": "Мика понял: незнакомое не обязательно опасно. Иногда достаточно научиться понимать друг друга.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch05_clips/ru/CH05_P02_L002_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 7.079,
      "camera_target": [
        0.66,
        0.126,
        0.245
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "56f471e4381668912c9a58dc74dec9d8f806b26d5f884c4efb64388ef0c46fdc"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH05_P02_L003",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P02_F02",
      "panel_id": "p52_magnetic_hall",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_034",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Привет!",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch05_clips/ru/CH05_P02_L003_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 0.993,
      "camera_target": [
        0.455,
        0.168,
        0.123
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "6f73f78834012792f6270bce46f842860a7b2cd427c2242ee8ac63ac1f01cc73"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH05_P02_L004",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P02_F02",
      "panel_id": "p52_magnetic_hall",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Мы рады, что ты добрался до нас.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch05_clips/ru/CH05_P02_L004_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 2.351,
      "camera_target": [
        0.635,
        0.177,
        0.125
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "59b1847f4b06efa02a9f172bc9c24c9c76b29b45a74408cbf4e7a235f2af276d"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH05_P02_L005",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P02_F02",
      "panel_id": "p52_magnetic_hall",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_036",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Нам есть что тебе рассказать.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch05_clips/ru/CH05_P02_L005_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 2.351,
      "camera_target": [
        0.876,
        0.177,
        0.119
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "c91d970993462c4fa0adeee583b94831960ac8d4c9600802106ed47d0dfe6ca8"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH05_P02_L006",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P02_F03",
      "panel_id": "p52_mika_meets_magnetic",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Здравствуйте! Я так рад, что вы оказались друзьями!",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch05_clips/ru/CH05_P02_L006_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 4.049,
      "camera_target": [
        0.19,
        0.43,
        0.23
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "b346e892a3290e325c6e6591b54d0d132f16e6313a42d136f185f1a65550ae39"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH05_P02_L007",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P02_F03",
      "panel_id": "p52_mika_meets_magnetic",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Не переживай. Пойдём, я тебе кое-что покажу.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch05_clips/ru/CH05_P02_L007_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 3.318,
      "camera_target": [
        0.3,
        0.56,
        0.24
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "387de79fa3f7b030f30b8771d090394b92dceb640fa27af6417f5c6e2ac67c07"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH05_P02_L008",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P02_F04",
      "panel_id": "p52_portal_discovery",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "kind": "narration",
      "spoken_text": "Жители Геоны показали Мике своё любимое занятие — эксперименты с гравитацией.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch05_clips/ru/CH05_P02_L008_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 5.799,
      "camera_target": [
        0.76,
        0.485,
        0.29
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "0424cd56b4ee6adeb79b90c8f1ca4a3d546078d2c2bcfc8b1207539b4242b350"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH05_P02_L009",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P02_F04",
      "panel_id": "p52_portal_discovery",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Вау!",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch05_clips/ru/CH05_P02_L009_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 1.411,
      "camera_target": [
        0.6,
        0.51,
        0.2
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "d969cb3a3024c109a4fcbd216b6b39feea5bb629ded6cd560b71607c86ea04d9"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH05_P02_L010",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P02_F04",
      "panel_id": "p52_portal_discovery",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_035",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Мы можем немного управлять гравитацией и пространством. Ты тоже можешь попробовать!",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch05_clips/ru/CH05_P02_L010_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 5.564,
      "camera_target": [
        0.79,
        0.58,
        0.25
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "5621b185e4da014d3486c1dab04104fcdb8aa1a61147310d832566b1ca5d6d9b"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH05_P02_L011",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P02_F05",
      "panel_id": "p52_mika_talks",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Вы ждали меня? Значит, вы знаете, откуда я?",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch05_clips/ru/CH05_P02_L011_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 3.788,
      "camera_target": [
        0.145,
        0.816,
        0.215
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0,
      "transition_style": "cut",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "23cf124c97c457e9f142a0101a62fca878a23a327c49ad2d0b193580f3ac7219"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH05_P02_L012",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P02_F05",
      "panel_id": "p52_mika_talks",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_034",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "spoken_text": "Не спеши. Мы всё объясним. Отправляйся на нашу станцию — «Перевёрнутая пирамида». Там хранятся знания, которые помогут тебе понять, что происходит.",
      "audio_path": "res://mika_motion_comic/ch05_clips/ru/CH05_P02_L012_ru.mp3",
      "audio_duration_s": 11.154,
      "camera_target": [
        0.285,
        0.845,
        0.2
      ],
      "transition_before_s": 0.25,
      "transition_style": "pan",
      "camera_visible_lead_s": 0.12,
      "transition_sfx_path": "",
      "voice_start_rule": "after_camera_presented_and_sfx_finished",
      "audio_kind": "voice",
      "sha256": "471ac32b26da9fa77232b545d97a8cc0ba6151e8a9576540ecde56c0029a82c5"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH05_P02_L013",
      "frame_id": "CH05_P02_F06",
      "panel_id": "p52_ship_departure",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "kind": "caption",
      "spoken_text": "«Перевёрнутая пирамида» — архивная станция магнитной цивилизации.",
